{"id":"pepel","lemma":"пепел","pos":"noun","rank":4141,"glosses":["ash, ashes"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1b/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%B5%D0%BB.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%B5%D0%BF%D0%B5%D0%BB.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"пепла","plural":"пеплы"},"examples":[{"text":"После пожара остался только пепел.","en":"After the fire, only ash was left.","words":[{"g":"after"},{"g":"fire, conflagration","l":"пожар"},{"g":"to remain, to stay","l":"остаться"},{"g":"only"},null]},{"text":"Наша деревня превратилась в пепел.","en":"Our village was reduced to ashes.","words":[{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},{"g":"village, hamlet"},{"g":"to turn into","l":"превратиться"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Сильный огонь превратил весь город в пепел.","en":"The big fire reduced the whole town to ashes.","words":[{"g":"strong, powerful"},{"g":"fire"},{"g":"to turn into","l":"превратить"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"city, town"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Пожар превратил дом в груду пепла.","en":"The fire reduced the house to ashes.","words":[{"g":"fire, conflagration"},{"g":"to turn into","l":"превратить"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"in"},null,null]},{"text":"Вулканический пепел накрыл город.","en":"Volcanic ash covered the city.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"city, town"}]}]}